Subject: [PATCH 06/10] sigma-dut: Modify wireless/wsplcd/repacd config

This change removes/adds some wireless/wsplcd/repacd config to support
MAP with HMT.

CRs-Fixed: 3893994
Change-Id: I67850414e18c6ebb8133643805a7a40a8b71018f
Signed-off-by: Chenming Huang <quic_chenhuan@quicinc.com>
